    <defName>HE_Inti_BS_TerraceFarmer</defName>
    <title>terrace farmer</title>
    <titleShort>farmer</titleShort>
    <description>[PAWN_nameDef] farmed a staircase of fields on a mountainside, potatoes at the top, maize at the bottom and quinoa in between. [PAWN_pronoun] can rebuild a fallen terrace wall in a day.</description>
